+// lightningpanda: the bytecode cache of JSModuleLoaderRefPrivate.h (JSCachedSource). The embedder
+// stores, per source text, what generateBytecodeCacheEntry makes, and gives it back with the text
+// (makeBytecodeCacheSource). CodeCache then decodes the code where it would parse and compile
+// (CodeCacheMap::fetchFromDisk, which asks the provider), a function's code at its first call,
+// and makeModule fills a module's record without a parse (CodeCache::cachedModuleRecord).
